  (text "PERIMETER-FIRST PIN ALLOCATION\nAll 152 bus signals and 13 FT245 signals connect to U1; CLK_50M is reserved for the oscillator.\nA7 = target clock (PCLKT0_0); G1 = sampling clock (GR_PCLK7_1).\nUse outer BGA rows/columns before inner rings, subject to pin-function and boot constraints.\nSee fpga_pins.csv and 68008ice.lpf for assignments and remaining spare pins."
    (at 195.58 302.26 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "3244e7e5-2148-5bae-9bcc-a19566e06121"))
  (text "POWER / BOOT DESIGN STILL REQUIRED\nNominal rails: VCC 1.1 V, VCCAUX 2.5 V, VCCIO 3.3 V (verify speed-grade limits).\nRegulators, sequencing, monitor and baseline decoupling are on the power sheet.\nCFG straps select master-SPI 010; PROGRAMN / INITN / DONE have pull-ups.\nHardware qualifies the arm request with power-good, DONE and INITN.\nValidate the CABGA-256 footprint from package drawing; footprint deliberately unset."
    (at 195.58 342.9 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "3a4dcd0c-0f05-5af7-a82d-762bb5e89789"))
